{{Short description|Football tournament group stage}}
{{Use dmy dates|date=June 2018}}
Play in '''Group D of the [[1990 FIFA World Cup]]''' completed on 19 June 1990. [[Germany national football team|West Germany]] won the group, and advanced to the second round, along with [[Yugoslavia national football team|Yugoslavia]] and [[Colombia national football team|Colombia]]. The [[United Arab Emirates national football team|United Arab Emirates]] failed to advance.<ref>{{cite web |url=https://www.rsssf.org/tables/90full.html |title=World Cup 1990 |publisher=[[RSSSF]] |access-date=30 April 2026}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |title=FIFA World Cup 1990, football - table and standings, match results, schedule, stats, videos, news |url=https://soccer365.net/competitions/742/1990/ |access-date=2025-06-10 |website=soccer365.net}}</ref>

